OL,3,GNEWSAReduced rail service continues due
OL,4,Ato dry weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year, the reduced timetable stayed
OL,7,Fin place until November 29 but SWR's
OL,8,Fmanaging director Lawrence Bowman said
OL,9,Fthe timetable would be restored "as
OL,10,Fsoon as possible".
